.TH "dirtygarden-by-faemiyah" "6" "2026-11-14" "Dirty Garden User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
dirtygarden-by-faemiyah - the command to run Dirty Garden.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
dirtygarden-by-faemiyah [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Dirty Garden is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah in August 2011.
It ended 8th at the Assembly 2011 4k intro compo.
.PP
Trilkk [Code]
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Warma [Additional code]
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Juippi [Music]
.PP
The intro starts in a resizable window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
-f, --fullscreen
Start in fullscreen mode.
.TP
-w, --windowed
Start in a window (default).
.TP
-n, --no-fullscreen
Same as --windowed.
.TP
-r, --record
Do not run in real time: write every frame to dirty_garden_NNNN.png and
the soundtrack to dirty_garden_audio.raw in the current directory.
.PP
Any other argument prints the list of valid options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
F
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
Any other key
Quit.
